<title>USA: Tonganoxie, Kan., yields 5.80 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Tonganoxie, Kan., yields 5.80 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stifel Nicolaus &amp; Co Inc said it priced $1.500 million of Tonganoxie, Kan., water and sewage system revenue bonds, Series 1996 with a top yield of 5.80 percent in 2016.</p>
